5. PAID LICENSE TERMS

When You hold a valid paid license key issued by the Licensor:

  (a) You may use the Software in production for Commercial Use, up to
      the domain limit specified in Your license key.

  (b) Your license is valid until the expiration date embedded in Your
      license key. Renewal is subject to the then-current pricing
      published at https://kubepanel.io/pricing.

  (c) Graceful Degradation: If Your paid license expires, the Software
      will not terminate or disrupt existing hosted websites or services.
      Enforcement of an expired license is limited to preventing the
      creation of new hosted domains beyond the Community Use limit until
      a valid license is obtained. This graceful degradation guarantee is
      a material term of the paid license.

  (d) License keys are issued to a single legal entity and may not be
      shared, transferred, or used by a different legal entity without
      the Licensor's prior written consent.

  (e) Use across multiple separate installations or clusters requires a
      separate license key per installation unless otherwise agreed in
      writing with the Licensor.


